<Base
  title="Contact Dnaso"
  description="Get in touch with the Dnaso editorial team — corrections, questions, or feedback on our home backup power guides."
>
  <div class="wrap page">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p>Questions about a guide? Spotted an outdated cost figure or a spec we got wrong? We want to hear about it — accuracy is the whole point of this site.</p>
    <p>Email us at: <strong>hello@dnaso.com</strong></p>
    <p>We read everything, though we can't always reply individually. Corrections backed by a manufacturer spec sheet or a licensed electrician's quote get priority.</p>
    <h2>What we can't help with</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We don't sell, install, or service generators or batteries.</li>
      <li>We can't size a system for your specific home over email — that needs an on-site assessment by a licensed electrician.</li>
      <li>We don't offer advertising or sponsored-content placements.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
